    <section class="section" id="en-seccion-1"><span class="number">01</span><div><h2>Service and scope</h2><p>Releva RF is a mobile and Wi-Fi survey and analysis tool developed by KronAR Studio. Results are supporting field data and do not replace calibrated instruments, regulatory assessments, or safety checks required by applicable rules.</p></div></section>
    <section class="section" id="en-seccion-2"><span class="number">02</span><div><h2>Permitted use</h2><p>Use the app only when authorized to take measurements or record information at the relevant sites. Respect third-party privacy and applicable safety, access and telecommunications requirements.</p></div></section>
    <section class="section" id="en-seccion-3"><span class="number">03</span><div><h2>Measurement accuracy</h2><p>Results depend on the phone, sensors, permissions, coverage, third-party services and local conditions. Absolute precision or uninterrupted availability of GPS, RF data, maps, automated analysis or speed tests is not guaranteed.</p></div></section>
    <section class="section" id="en-seccion-4"><span class="number">04</span><div><h2>Accounts, subscriptions and payments</h2><p>Where applicable, Releva RF may require an account and a subscription managed through Google Play. Commercial terms, price, renewals and cancellation are displayed by Google Play before purchase. Connecting Google Drive is optional and is not a mandatory part of payment.</p></div></section>
    <section class="section" id="en-seccion-5"><span class="number">05</span><div><h2>Files and backups</h2><p>Projects stored only inside the app may be lost when it is uninstalled or its data is cleared. Export and import features allow you to manage your own copies. If enabled, Google Drive stores backups in the Google account you select. Users should verify that important backups have completed successfully.</p></div></section>
    <section class="section" id="en-seccion-6"><span class="number">06</span><div><h2>Ownership and responsibility</h2><p>You retain control of the surveys you create and are responsible for having the necessary rights to collect, store and share them. Do not distribute backups containing confidential information without proper authorization.</p></div></section>
    <section class="section" id="en-seccion-7"><span class="number">07</span><div><h2>Changes, support and contact</h2><p>Features, these terms and accompanying documentation may be updated to reflect technical or legal changes. Contact kronarstudio@gmail.com for support or questions. Mandatory consumer rights under applicable law are not waived by these terms.</p></div></section>
